title: Authorizations › New Case › Referral › Header actions
route: /authorizations/new/referral/RF-2053?draft=draft-1001
intro: The buttons in the header card of the full referral page. The decision buttons open the same dialogs as the checklist, and 'Accept referral' is disabled in the same way. 'Start a case from this referral', 'Owner', 'Add note' and 'More' are only here.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: 'Demo: simulate the referrer's reply' plays the referrer. 'Download' and the print button save nothing.
---
start s1 "On the full referral page\nheader card"

group gDec "Decision buttons (left)"
  decision dReq "Is a required finding still open?\nSame six as the checklist"
  toast tDis "'Accept referral' is disabled\nLine under the buttons: 'Resolve 4 items first: …'\n'Mark OK', a reply or 'Request information' lifts an item"
  click cAcc "Click 'Accept referral'\nWhile open"
  click cReq "Click 'Request information'\nOnly while New or In review"
  click cDec "Click 'Decline'\nWhile open"
endgroup
goto gAcc "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Referral › Accept a referral"
goto gAsk "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Referral › Ask the referrer"
goto gOk "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Referral › Mark OK or decline"
click cSt "Click 'Schedule intake', 'Mark admitted'\nor 'Change intake'\nAccepted and Scheduled only"
goto gSt "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Referral › Schedule intake"
click cRe "Click 'Reopen referral'\nDeclined only"
click cStart "Click 'Start a case from this referral'\nShown unless the referral is declined or already has a case"
process pStart "Opens /authorizations/new?referral=RF-2053\nA new case is made from the referral and opens on Intake with the referral's details filled in"
goto gNew "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › How a case starts and resumes"
store stRe "Referral is In review again\nTimeline 'You reopened the referral'\nToast 'Referral reopened'"

group gOwn "Owner"
  click cOwn "Open 'Owner' and pick a person\nJordan Perez, Taylor Brooks, Morgan Lee or Unassigned"
  store stOwn "Owner is saved\nA New referral moves to In review when it gets an owner\nTimeline 'Assigned to Taylor Brooks'"
  toast tOwn "'Assigned to Taylor Brooks'\n'RF-2053'\nUnassigned: 'Owner removed'"
endgroup

click cNote "Click 'Add note'"
goto gNote "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Referral › Full page: Fit, Activity and notes"

group gMore "More"
  click cMore "Click 'More'"
  overlay oMore "Menu\n'Demo: simulate the referrer's reply'\n'Download the source document'\n'Copy link to this referral'"
  click cReply "Pick 'Demo: simulate the referrer's reply'"
  click cDown "Pick 'Download the source document'"
  click cCopy "Pick 'Copy link to this referral'"
  decision dHost "Is this the hosted preview?"
  toast tHost "'Copy link is off in this preview'\n'Open the single-file version of the demo to use it.'"
  process pCopy "Page address is copied to the clipboard"
  toast tCopy "'Link copied'\n'It opens this referral for anyone on your team.'"
  toast tDown "'Downloading the original'\n'RF-2053.pdf, 2 pages. This is a demo, so no file is saved.'"
endgroup
goto gReply "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Referral › The referrer replies"

s1 --> dReq
dReq -->|Yes| tDis
dReq -->|No| cAcc --> gAcc
s1 --> cReq --> gAsk
s1 --> cDec --> gOk
s1 --> cSt --> gSt
s1 --> cRe --> stRe
s1 --> cStart --> pStart --> gNew
s1 --> cOwn --> stOwn --> tOwn
s1 --> cNote --> gNote
s1 --> cMore --> oMore
oMore --> cReply --> gReply
oMore --> cDown --> tDown
oMore --> cCopy --> dHost
dHost -->|Yes| tHost
dHost -->|No| pCopy --> tCopy
